msgid "Commercial Support and Tools"
msgstr "商业支持与工具"

#: ../../source/docs/common-commercial-support.rst:8
#: 2d2fc36c8812468f91c78f39887a1918
msgid "Consultation"
msgstr "咨询"

#: ../../source/docs/common-commercial-support.rst:9
#: 6b64aecf6cb34264bd47d915cd92dc0f
msgid ""
"The following is a list of individuals and companies that can provide "
"commercial (i.e. paid) support for ArduPilot including vehicle design, "
"tuning, log analysis, bug fixes and enhancements."
msgstr "以下是可为 ArduPilot 提供商业（即付费）支持的个人和公司列表，服务包括飞行器设计、调参、日志分析、Bug 修复和功能增强。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-commercial-support.rst:14
#: 0799577a19e749c49fe499e291086f5f
msgid ""
"This is for commercial support.  For unpaid support by volunteers please "
"visit the `forums <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__"
msgstr "本列表为商业支持。如需志愿者提供的免费支持，请访问 `论坛 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-commercial-support.rst:296
#: 472b1f83793545369b78efb9572fa857
msgid "How to get added to this list"
msgstr "如何加入此列表"

#: ../../source/docs/common-commercial-support.rst:298
#: aee5e1f53a9c4ceeaa15e66af5382940
msgid ""
"If you or your company wants to be listed here please email "
"partners@ardupilot.org. To be added to this page we request the applicant "
"has made a contribution to ArduPilot or a related project in some way. This "
"includes code, documentation or helping people on the forums. The intention "
"with this policy is to ensure that companies listed here will be active "
"participants in the community."
msgstr ""
"如果您或您的公司希望在此处列出，请发送电子邮件至 partners@ardupilot.org。要添加到此页面，我们要求申请者以某种方式为 "
"ArduPilot 或相关项目做出贡献。这包括代码、文档或在论坛上帮助他人。此政策的目的是确保此处列出的公司将积极参与社区活动。"

